drag selection toString: "Use your shell tool to run exactly: echo hello-14"
--- drag inside message -> clipboard text (pasted into editor) ---
"Use your shell tool to run exactly: echo hello-14"
ctrl+a selection toString: ""
--- Ctrl+A after clicking in message -> clipboard text (pasted into editor) ---
"Use your shell tool to run exactly: echo hello-14"
ctrl+a (sidebar) selection toString: ""
--- Ctrl+A after clicking empty sidebar -> clipboard text (pasted into editor) ---
"Use your shell tool to run exactly: echo hello-14"
